    "steps_section_8HLhyT": {
      "type": "steps-section",
      "blocks": {
        "step_68VrLB": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/8da47f71baecca601cb9056e2c556321.png",
            "title": "Initial Inspection",
            "text": "<p>Our team of expert technicians carefully inspect, test, and diagnose the fundamental parts of every machine first. This includes:</p><ul><li>Heart Rate Monitor (Connection, Accuracy Display)</li><li>Display Console (Programs, Buttons, LEDs)</li><li>Special Features (Resistance, Speed, Incline)<br/></li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "step_p6Fk8X": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/5e54f173e1e59fba7fdbc3e20488fb9d.png",
            "title": "Noise Review",
            "text": "<p>Our technicians inspect the machines for any unusual noises during operation. Any system flaws identified during this inspection are promptly repaired or the affected parts are replaced with new ones to ensure optimal performance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "step_iWtRPL": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/a5b26f6dd24ff73ae938b64288a40838.png",
            "title": "Disassembly",
            "text": "<p>Each machine is fully disassembled, thoroughly cleaned, and further inspected by our technicians.</p>"
          }
        },
        "step_ydRCbL": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/49188d08440e8160748173daf1c188c3.png",
            "title": "Parts Replacement",
            "text": "<p>Our replacement process ensures that every piece of equipment meets the highest standards of performance and reliability:</p><ul><li>Mechanical Parts: Any mechanical part showing more than 25% wear is replaced with a new one to maintain optimal functionality.</li><li>Drive Belts: All units receive new drive belts, ensuring smooth and efficient operation.</li><li>Walking Belts: For treadmills, new walking belts are installed on all models except Woodways, which have a different belt system.</li><li>Hardware Inspection: All hardware, chains, pulleys, cables, and wheels are thoroughly inspected. Any components found to be worn or damaged are replaced as needed.</li><li>Batteries: Every unit is equipped with a new battery to guarantee reliable power and performance.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "step_b9GLbP": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/e1a748668ff8a26628fb1b6e64962180.png",
            "title": "Re-assembly",
            "text": "<p>After replacements are completed, the machine is meticulously reassembled according to factory specifications. It is then restored to a \"like new\" cosmetic condition, ensuring it looks and functions as if it were brand new.</p>"
          }
        },
        "step_NVaXwy": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/9cae5d33b364a1ad83b357aea71c89d5.png",
            "title": "Exterior Restoration",
            "text": "<p>The exterior restoration process involves several steps to ensure the machines look as good as new:</p><ul><li>Machines with heavy wear are sandblasted down to the original steel, while those with light scratches are carefully sanded by hand to remove imperfections.</li><li>Using the latest technology, machines are repainted to eliminate any imperfections and prevent future discoloration. Custom colors are available upon request to match specific preferences.</li><li>All worn plastic, vinyl, rubber, foam, and end caps are replaced.</li><li>Power cords are thoroughly inspected for any signs of wear and tear, and are replaced if necessary.</li><li>Lubricants and waxes are applied to moving parts to ensure optimal function and extend the machine's longevity.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "step_rXD3cj": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/Final_inspection.jpg",
            "title": "Final Inspection",
            "text": "<p>In the final stage, our technicians conduct a thorough re-inspection and retest every function of the machine. This ensures that each unit meets our rigorous standards for 100% functionality, reliability, and performance.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
